# Copy to `.env` to author a game outside this repository.
#
# `content/` at the repository root is the fixture: the minimum valid project
# the Rust tests, the web tests and the smoke harness run against. It is not
# where a game is written.
#
# Point this at the content directory of the game you are authoring. The dev
# server serves it, the editor uploads into it, and `npm run build` mirrors it
# into the bundle. A relative path resolves against the repository root.
#
# See docs/adr/ADR-0019-authoring-content-workspace.md.

# INSULAIRE_CONTENT_DIR=/absolute/path/to/your-game/content
